			<span class="footer-link-icon">
				<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.1-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.9 12 21 12 21z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.4"></circle></svg>
